 'Preparation phase: a square 20 cm metal baking tin lined with parchment and overhanging handles; separate bowls of plain rolled oats, chopped almonds in 5 mm pieces, dark seedless raisins, shelled sunflower seeds, smooth peanut butter and amber honey. Tiny vanilla and salt dishes. No mixed dough, shaped bars or chocolate. Ingredients separated clearly.',
