 'Mixing phase: a large glass bowl with rolled oats, chopped almonds, sunflower seeds and dark raisins completely coated in a sticky light tan honey-peanut binder. A spatula folding the coarse mixture. Whole ingredients visible, not a smooth blended dough. No shaped bars or chocolate.',
